{
  "name": "Automated Follow-up Email Sequence",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "add-followup-contact",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Add Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.body.subject || 'Following up on our conversation' }}",
        "message": "Hi {{ $json.body.name }},\n\nThank you for your interest. I wanted to reach out and see if you had any questions about {{ $json.body.topic || 'our services' }}.\n\nI'd love to schedule a quick call to discuss how we can help.\n\nBest regards",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Send Initial Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "email", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.email }}" },
              { "column": "name", "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.name }}" },
              { "column": "initialSentAt", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
              { "column": "replied", "value": "false" },
              { "column": "status", "value": "initial_sent" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [750, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "days"
      },
      "name": "Wait 3 Days",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1000, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "filters": {
          "column": "email",
          "value": "={{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.email }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Check Reply Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.replied }}",
              "rightValue": "false",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "If No Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "Re: {{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.subject || 'Following up on our conversation' }}",
        "message": "Hi {{ $('Webhook - Add Contact').item.json.body.name }},\n\nI wanted to follow up on my previous email. I understand you're busy, but I'd love to connect when you have a moment.\n\nWould any of these times work for a quick 15-minute call?\n- Tomorrow morning\n- Thursday afternoon\n- Friday morning\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Send Follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1750, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Follow-up Email Sequence\n\nSends initial email and follows up after 3 days if no reply.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Webhook receives contact details\n2. Send initial email via Gmail\n3. Log contact to Sheets\n4. Wait 3 days\n5. Check Sheets for reply status\n6. If no reply → send follow-up email\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect Gmail OAuth2 credentials\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials\n- Create spreadsheet with columns: email, name, initialSentAt, replied, status\n- POST to webhook: {\"email\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"subject\": \"...\", \"topic\": \"...\"}",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 340
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -90]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - Add Contact": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Initial Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Initial Email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Log to Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 3 Days",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait 3 Days": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Reply Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Reply Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "If No Reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "If No Reply": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Follow-up",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}